    skos:changeNote "v1.1.0 (2026-10-06): the knowledge-base module is now 2.37.0 (five lessons, L-128 to L-132). Nothing else changed."@en,
        "v1.10.0 (2026-10-07): re-derived after the governing pack added L-144 (tools that each keep their own list of what not to read drift apart); the knowledge-base module is 2.46.0. Nothing else changed."@en,
        "v1.11.0 (2026-10-07): re-derived after the governing pack added L-145 (a serializer can rewrite a literal's written form, so a proof of no loss must compare values and count the rewrites); the knowledge-base module is 2.47.0. Nothing else changed."@en,
        "v1.12.0 (2026-10-07): re-derived after the governing pack's release 21.15.0. The pack's change was in its release-history module, which this package does not carry; nothing else changed."@en,
        "v1.13.0 (2026-10-07): re-derived after the governing pack added BP-D55 and L-146 to L-149; the knowledge-base module is 2.48.0. Nothing else changed."@en,
        "v1.14.0 (2026-10-07): re-derived after the governing pack added L-150 and extended BP-D55 with rule R9; the knowledge-base module is 2.49.0 (L-150 and BP-D55 extended with rule R9). Nothing else changed."@en,
        "v1.15.0 (2026-10-11): re-derived after the governing package changed 1 module(s): http://example.org/knowledge-base. Nothing else changed."@en,
        "v1.16.0 (2026-10-12): re-derived after the governing package changed 1 module(s): http://example.org/knowledge-base. Nothing else changed."@en,
        "v1.17.0 (2026-10-12): re-derived after the governing package changed 1 module(s): http://example.org/knowledge-base. Nothing else changed."@en,
