    dcterms:source "Migrated from redo:BP4_HonestDisclosures (oepack_lessons_rdf_v1_0_0.ttl). Semantic deduplication against D-prefixed BPs deferred. (See pre-migration source statement(s) above.)"@en,
        "Sprint 0 closure pattern."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/knowledge-base> ;
    skos:definition "Every Sprint/Phase closure document must include a §Honest disclosures section that surfaces scope decisions, deferred items, and known limitations. This makes future audits easier and prevents over-claiming."@en ;
    skos:related <http://example.org/oepack-lessons-rdf#Lesson_L04>,
