    kb:verifiedOn "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    skos:definition "What it gave to the taxonomy: BFO 2020 categories as described: independent continuants (material entities, immaterial entities such as sites and fiat boundaries), specifically dependent continuants (qualities, realizable entities: roles, dispositions, functions), generically dependent continuants (copiable: novels, software, datasets)."@en ;
