    kb:hasSourceKind "primary" ;
    kb:verifiedOn "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    skos:definition "What it gave to the taxonomy: Continuant and occurrent are disjoint; quality against realizable entity; a disposition needs a material bearer and is internally grounded, a role is optional and externally grounded and can be borne by immaterial entities."@en ;
