    dcterms:source "The owner's request of 2026-10-20 (the same research and taxonomy for classes, jointly with the taxonomy of relationships) and the literature research of that date, recorded in RELATIONSHIP_TAXONOMY_RESEARCH_v1_11_0.md."@en ;
    dcterms:title "Sessility (motility)"@en ;
    dcterms:creator "Wikipedia" ;
