    kb:verifiedOn "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    skos:definition "What it gave to the taxonomy: Preferred, alternative and hidden labels; at most one preferred label per language tag; the three label properties are pairwise disjoint; exact match is symmetric, transitive and disjoint with broad and related match; close match is symmetric and not transitive."@en ;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-10-20T00:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo oe-prov:Agent_MethodAuthor .

