        kb:ClassFacetValue_Stratum_Psychical,
        kb:ClassFacetValue_Stratum_Cultural ;
    skos:definition "The stratum of reality at which the things of a class lie: inorganic, organic, psychical, or intellectual and cultural. Each stratum rests on the lower one and adds something the lower does not contain. The method reads the strata as a facet of kinds that sit clearly in one of them; a kind that spans several (a human being) carries none."@en ;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-10-20T00:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo oe-prov:Agent_MethodAuthor .

