    skos:definition "Was generated by joins an entity and an activity; used an activity and an entity; was attributed to an entity and an agent; was associated with an activity and an agent; acted on behalf of two agents. Appended 2026-10-21: an entity of the model is a physical, digital, conceptual or other kind of thing (PROV-DM), so a claim or another abstract entity is an entity; derivation between two claims is provenance."@en ;
